  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.6 Configuration & Code Quality Release: 🔧 BREAKING: Fixed Azure B2C configuration property names (TenantName → TenantId), Updated default provider settings (Azure B2C enabled, Google disabled). ✨ NEW: Improved configuration file organization (SA1402 compliance), Enhanced session options with additional security properties, Comprehensive security validation and middleware. 🐛 FIXES: Resolved Azure B2C provider registration issues, Fixed missing SessionOptions properties, Corrected callback path configurations. ⚡ QUALITY: Reduced method complexity (29→<10, 28→<10), Split monolithic configuration files, Added comprehensive security tests. Clean separation of provider configurations for maintainability.",
